2. Input resolution
   a. For every node use only inputs listed in that component's requiredInputs (include all mandatory; optional only if clearly beneficial and resolvable).
       - This rule applies recursively: within each input, all mandatory properties (and their nested mandatory properties) MUST also be provided.
       - Optional properties at any nesting level should only be included if clearly beneficial and resolvable.
   b. Inputs MUST follow the detail-level JSON schema `elementInput` which is an object with exactly one of two valid shapes:
